WEBVTT

00:01:29.492 --> 00:01:33.871
Ko'p o'tmay shifokorlar odamni bu
tarzda ishontirishning boshqa bir

00:01:33.871 --> 00:01:35.743
istiqbolini angladi: tibbiy sinovlar.

00:01:35.743 --> 00:01:39.894
1950-yillarda tadqiqotchilar plasebolardan
yangi muolajalarini sinovdan o’tkazishda

00:01:39.894 --> 00:01:41.847
dasturilamal sifatida foydalanayotgan edi

00:01:41.847 --> 00:01:43.687
Misol uchun, yangi dorini baholashda

00:01:43.687 --> 00:01:46.553
sinovdagi bemorlarning yarmi haqiqiy 
dorini ichishi mumkin.

00:01:46.553 --> 00:01:49.902
Qolgan yarmi esa xuddi shu 
ko’rinishdagi platseboni ichadi.

00:01:49.902 --> 00:01:54.213
Tadqiqotchilar agar bemorlar haqiqiy yoki 
sohta narsa o’rtasidagi farqni bilishmasa,

00:01:54.213 --> 00:01:56.242
natijalarda tarafkashlik bo’lmaydi,

00:01:56.242 --> 00:01:57.879
deb ishonishardi.

00:01:57.879 --> 00:02:02.001
So’ng agar yangi dori platseboga nisbatan
sezilarli darajada foyda bersa,